# Shell scripts run inside Linux containers. A CRLF checkout on Windows makes
# the kernel read the shebang as `/bin/sh`, and the postgres entrypoint dies
# with "/bin/sh^M: bad interpreter" part-way through initialising the database.
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
